      "body": "Exact-head non-author review APPROVED at db98d761ce17d51e2b2ac1abe3826a8b228cfe61. Reviewed canonical sequencing, peer file/run ownership, source-shape boundary, matched-comparator and relevance scope, retained geometry/donor interfaces and conditional diagnostic decisions. No unresolved required changes.\n\nExecuted documentation checks: python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py and git diff --check pass. The historical five status names are compatibility acknowledgements, not tests. mission-delivery-gate lacks an ops envelope and is advisory under the current D18/D19 rule; its failure is not reported as a passing scientific check.\n\nIndependent review retained at research/geometric-chat-source-binding-20261003/plan-review.md.\n",
